#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:5 0cfb291e498d4111a603eca566af6d81
msgid "Using SITL with JSBSim"
msgstr "将 SITL 与 JSBSim 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:7 85099458cf8e4fe386df7db046a64036
msgid ""
"JSBSim is a sophisticated flight simulator that is used as the core flight "
"dynamics system for several well known flight simulation systems."
msgstr "JSBSim 是一款复杂的飞行仿真器，被用作多个知名飞行仿真系统的核心飞行动力学系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:11 22b0916964af4d608195ad813c9b0879
msgid ""
"In the past ArduPilot required a special version of JSBSim. As of December "
"2018 that is no longer the case, and we can use the standard JSBSim "
"releases."
msgstr ""
"过去 ArduPilot 需要使用特殊版本的 JSBSim。自 2018 年 12 月起，情况不再如此，现在可以使用标准的 JSBSim 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:15 6742b67dbb8d42638d6c2bfbaf273633
msgid "In order to build JSBSIM, you need Cmake, install it with :"
msgstr "构建 JSBSim 需要 Cmake，使用以下命令安装："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:23 46826ee763e643f7915fe7cf7893f0e5
msgid ""
"The build commands below are contained within ``Tools/scripts/build-"
"jsbsim.sh``."
msgstr "以下构建命令包含在 ``Tools/scripts/build-jsbsim.sh`` 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:25 a7c819e1e3d447b3bfdcdf0cd7beeaf0
msgid "In the same directory (your home directory) run these commands:"
msgstr "在同一目录（您的主目录）中运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:36 2f9fdbc043da44c1a68bcfc0d46bcfb7
msgid ""
"Add JSBSim executable to your search path. Add the line at the end of your "
"\".bashrc\" in your home directory to automatically set the path whenever a "
"new terminal is opened."
msgstr "将 JSBSim 可执行文件添加到搜索路径。将该行添加到主目录下「.bashrc」的末尾，以便每次打开新终端时自动设置路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-jsbsim.rst:42 fe213135b6bc473fb4c2d5921204ed41
msgid ""
"If using the JSBSim plane simulator you can specify a different JSBSim model"
